  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NYAMIRIMA COFFEE BUSINESS PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grant is focused on the production of Robusta and Arabica coffee and benefits 278 total members through the construction of a warehouse, increase in working capital and agro input fund, and the purchase of a truck to increase production volumes and the amount of coffee bulked.</narrative>
  </description>
